- `crates/vox-dashboard/app/src/tabs/command.vox`: Refactored 4 instances of self-closing component and primitive invocations by removing the redundant `() {}` syntax.
- `crates/vox-dashboard/app/src/tabs/speak.vox`: Refactored 2 instances of self-closing component and primitive invocations by removing the redundant `() {}` syntax.
- `.claude/settings.local.json`: Added a new `grep` command to the `Bash` task list.

